</code></pre>
<h3>40.4 <code>pipeline_runner.py</code></h3>
<pre><code class="language-text">PipelineRunner(h5_path)
PipelineRunner.build_hypercube(**kwargs)
PipelineRunner.solve_all_mp_batched(...)
</code></pre>
<h3>40.5 <code>streaming_nnls_constrained.py</code></h3>
