<hr />
<h2>41. Building the repository documentation</h2>
<p>The repository Makefile defines:</p>
<pre><code class="language-text">DOC  = docs/CubeFit.md
HTML = docs/CubeFit.html
PDF  = docs/CubeFit.pdf
</code></pre>
<p>and uses Pandoc for HTML and Pandoc + XeLaTeX for PDF.</p>
<p>The supplied <code>mkdocs.yml</code> points <code>docs_dir</code> at <code>docs</code> and lists
